                                "sense_id": "c3d07ad2-002e-38fc-8ecc-336fe73a5f23",
                                "text": "But here in England a comprachico is equal to a murderer, a candidate for the hangman's noose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d90c08a-c8f2-425d-a46f-98e920f2f3f9",
                                "sense_id": "c3d07ad2-002e-38fc-8ecc-336fe73a5f23",
                                "text": "He is angry and equips himself accordingly—with a penknife to give the offender a comprachico countenance, a mirror to show him the effect, and a pair of nailed boots to give him his dismissal."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
